WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
A little surprising, but it fits his rational and decisive character

2
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,640
That being the case

3
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,640
Since you sincerely invited me

4
00:00:08,570 --> 00:00:09,970
Then I won't be polite

5
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:17,000
Lord, blow it out

6
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,600
There are only two springs and two gold coins left to build the Dayuan Bed.

7
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,800
Go to the trading platform and build the bed first.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,400
Then I'll sleep for a while

9
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:33,600
I feel so tired after spending a lot of time physically.

10
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,400
My physical strength has also dropped by nearly 40 points.

11
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,600
Forty points of physical strength

12
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:39,000
If it were an ordinary household, it would be enough to kill one.

13
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:41,600
However, the Dayuan bed can restore 25 points of physical strength every hour.

14
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,600
Very practical indeed

15
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,980
If I let Wang Zixuan use his attributes for me,

16
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:48,380
Then can our physical strength be increased?
